    <ChangeLog Date="2025-03-20 16:00:00" Version="7.0.2">#Fix - DynamicFields bug on column creation screen.</ChangeLog>
    <ChangeLog Date="2023-11-23 13:00:00" Version="7.0.1">First Version to znuny 7.</ChangeLog>
    <Description Lang="en">Module to create a kanban board with tickets.</Description>
    <Description Lang="pt_BR">Módulo para criar um quadro de kanban com os chamados.</Description>
    <Description Lang="es">Módulo para crear un tablero kanban con el llamado.</Description>
    <Framework>7.0.x</Framework>
    <IntroInstall Lang="en" Title="Install Information" Type="pre"> 
        &lt;br&gt; 
        &lt;strong&gt;WELCOME&lt;/strong&gt;  
        &lt;br&gt; 
        &lt;br&gt; 
    
        You are about to install the package InBox Kanban. 
        &lt;br&gt; 
        &lt;br&gt; 
        &lt;strong&gt;REQUIRED InBox PACKAGES&lt;/strong&gt; 
        &lt;ul&gt; 
            &lt;li&gt; InBox Core 7.0.1 or superior &lt;/li&gt; 
        &lt;/ul&gt; 
        &lt;br&gt; 
        &lt;br&gt; 
        &lt;strong&gt;REQUIRED MODULE&lt;/strong&gt; 
        &lt;ul&gt; 
